{
  "title": "Ziyaarat-e-Ameerul Momeneen Imam Ali (a.s.)",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "اَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ اَیُّهَا الْوَصِیُّ الْبَرَّالتَّقِیُّ \nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAL WASIYYUL BARRAT TAQIYYO \nPeace be upon you, O righteous, god-fearing executor!\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ اَیُّهَا النَّبَأُ الْعَظِیْمُ \nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAN NABA-UL A’ZEEMO \nPeace be upon you, O Great News!\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ اَیُّهَا الصِّدِّیْقُ الرَّشِیْدُ \nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAS SIDDEEQUR RASHEEDO \nPeace be upon you, O rightly-guided, truthful one!\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ اَیُّهَا الْبَرُّ الزَّکِیُّ \nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAL BARRUZ ZAKIYYO \nPeace be upon you, O pious, pure one!\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ یَا خِیَرَۃَ اللّٰهِ عَلَی الْخَلْقِ اَجْمَعِیْنَ \nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA KHEYARATAL LAAHE A’LAL KHALQE AJMA-E’ENA\nPeace be upon you, O chosen elite of Allah over all creation!\nاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ حَبِیْبُ اللّٰهِ وَ خَاصَّۃُ اللّٰهِ وَ خَالِصَتُہٗ \nASHHADO ANNAKA HABEEBUL LAAHE WA KHAASSATUL LAAHE WA KHAALESATOHU\nI bear witness that you are the beloved of Allah, His specially chosen one, and His sincere friend.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَیْكَ یَا وَلِیَّ اللّٰهِ \nAS-SALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA WALIYYAL LAAHE \nPeace be upon you, O guardian appointed by Allah, \nوَ مَوْضِعَ سِرِّہٖ وَ عَیْبَۃَ عِلْمِہٖ وَ خَازِنَ وَحْیِہٖ \nWA MAWZE-A’ SIRREHI WA A’YBATA I’LMEHI WA KHAAZENA WAHYEHI\nthe repository of His secret, the chest of His knowledge, and the treasurer of His revelation!\nبِاَبِیْ اَنْتَ وَ اُمِّیْ یَا اَمِیْرَ الْمُؤْمِنِیْنَ \nBE-ABEE ANTA WA UMMEE YAA AMEERAL MO-MENEENA \nMay my father and my mother be sacrificed for you, O Commander of the Faithful!\nبِاَبِیْ اَنْتَ وَ اُمِّیْ یَا حُجَّۃَ اللّٰهِ عَلَی الْاَنَامِ \nBE-ABEE ANTA WA UMMEE YAA HUJJATAL LAAHE A’LAL ANAAME \nMay my father and my mother be sacrificed for you, O proof of Allah over mankind!\nبِاَبِیْ اَنْتَ وَ اُمِّیْ یَا بَابَ الْمَقَامِ \nBE-ABEE ANTA WA UMMEE YAA BAABAL MAQAAME \nMay my father and my mother be sacrificed for you, O gate to the high station!\nبِاَبِیْ اَنْتَ وَ اُمِّیْ یَا نُوْرَاللّٰهِ التَّامِّ \nBE-ABEE ANTA WA UMMEE YAA NOORAL LAAHIT TAAMME \nMay my father and my mother be sacrificed for you, O perfect light of Allah!\nاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ قَدْ بَلَّغْتَ عَنِ اللّٰهِ وَ عَنْ رَسُوْلِہٖ \nASHHADO ANNAKA QAD BALLAGHTA A’NIL LAAHE WA A’N RASOOLEHI\nI bear witness that you conveyed on behalf of Allah and His Messenger \nصَلَّی اللّٰهُ عَلَیْهِ وَ اٰلِہٖ \nSALLAL LAAHO A’LAYHE WA AALEHI\nmay the blessings of Allah be upon him and his family\nمَا حُمِّلْتَ وَ رَعَیْتَ مَا اسْتُحْفِظْتَ\nMAA HUMMILTA WA RA-A’YTA MAS TOHFIZTA\nwhat you were charged with, you protected what you were entrusted to guard, \nوَ حَفِظْتَ مَا اسْتُوْدِعْتَ \nWA HAFIZTA MAS TOODE’TA \nyou preserved what was deposited with you, \nوَ حَلَّلْتَ حَلَالَ اللّٰهِ \nWA HALLALTA HALAALAL LAAHE \nyou permitted what Allah made lawful, \nوَ حَرَّمْتَ حَرَامَ اللّٰهِ \nWA HARRAMTA HARAAMAL LAAHE \nyou forbade what Allah made unlawful, \nوَ اَتْمَمْتَ اَحْكَامَ اللّٰهِ \nWA ATMAMTA AHKAAMAL LAAHE \nyou fulfilled the ordinances of Allah, \nوَلَمْ تَتَعَدَّ حُدُوْدَ اللّٰهِ \nWA LAM TATA-A’DDA HODOODAL LAAHE\nand you never transgressed the bounds of Allah.\nعَبَدْتَ اللّٰهَ مُخْلِصًا حَتّٰی اَتَاكَ الْیَقِیْنُ\nA’BADTAL LAAHA MUKHLESAN HATTAA ATAAKAL YAQEENO \nYou worshipped Allah with absolute sincerity until death came to you.\nوَ صَلَّی اللّٰهُ عَلَیْكَ وَ عَلَی الْاَئِمَّۃِ مِنْ بَعْدِكَ.\nWA SALLAL LAAHO A’LAYKA WA A’LAL A-IMMATE MIM BA’DEKA.\nMay the blessings of Allah be upon you and upon the Imams after you."
}
